msgstr ""
"Brug <strong>Arrangementerappen</strong> til at administrere alle dine DIY-"
"workshops – fra syning og keramik til atelierets åbningstider."

#. module: diy_workshops
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:diy_workshops.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong>Events App</strong> to organize your classes and the "
"<strong>Purchase App</strong> to keep your workshop stocked with the right "
"materials. With the <strong>Website App</strong>, you can showcase your "
"studio, promote workshops, and let participants book their spots online."
msgstr ""
"Brug <strong>Arrangementerappen</strong> til at organisere dine kurser og "
"<strong>Indkøbsappen</strong> til at skaffe de rigtige materialer til dine "
"workshops. Med <strong>Hjemmesideappen</strong> kan du præsentere dit "
"atelier, reklamere for dine workshops og lade deltagerne reservere deres "
"pladser online."

#. module: diy_workshops
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:diy_workshops.welcome_article_body
